### CMake

```text
CMake
   ↓
Ninja
   ↓
Clang / MSVC / GCC
```

Recommended:

* CMake
* Ninja
* vcpkg or Conan
* Git
* GitHub Actions

Project:

```text
CMakeLists.txt
CMakePresets.json
```

