# 7. Mathematics Library

A game engine needs extensive math.

```text
Math
├── Vector2
├── Vector3
├── Vector4
├── Matrix4
├── Quaternion
├── Transform
├── Plane
├── Ray
├── AABB
├── Frustum
└── Interpolation
```

You can initially use:

**GLM**

Later, implement your own optimized math layer where useful.

