# PHASE 13 — Animation

Start with skeletal animation.

```text
Model
 ↓
Skeleton
 ↓
Bones
 ↓
Animation Clips
 ↓
Animator
```

Then:

```text
Idle
 ↓
Walk
 ↓
Run
 ↓
Jump
```

Build an animation state machine:

```text
Animator
 ├── Idle
 ├── Walk
 ├── Run
 └── Jump
```

---

# PHASE 14 — AI

Start simple.

```text
AI
├── State Machine
├── A*
├── Navigation
└── Behavior Tree
```

Example:

```text
Enemy

        Player visible?
          /     \
        Yes      No
        ↓        ↓
      Attack   Patrol
```

Later:

```text
NavMesh
A*
Behavior Tree
Utility AI
```

Use **Recast/Detour** for navigation if you don't want to implement NavMesh from scratch.

