# PHASE 21 — Packaging

Finally:

```text
Game
 ↓
Build System
 ↓
Asset Cooker
 ↓
Executable
 ↓
Package
```

Example:

```text
Build/
├── Game.exe
├── Engine.dll
├── Assets/
├── Shaders/
└── Config/
```

For release:

```text
Source Assets
      ↓
Asset Cooker
      ↓
Compressed Runtime Assets
      ↓
Game Package
```

